5
haahh := aaaha
ahhhh = haahh + haahh
haahh = haahh + haahh
ahhhh = ahhhh + haahh
ahhaa = haahh + ahhhh


Output


3
32767
0
0

Note

In the first test case the resulting value of d is hhahahaha.

